1. Definitions

1.1 "Software" means "Developer Workbench" (开发者工作台), including its source code, pages, artwork and graphic design, documentation, sample data, screenshots, and all accompanying files such as ai-proxy.js, as well as any later versions released by the Author.
1.2 "Author" means 赛博老爸 (@赛博老爸), the copyright holder of the Software.
1.3 "Personal Use" means use of the Software by a natural person, in a personal capacity, for their own learning, research, work, or management of their own projects. An independent developer using the Software to manage their own projects, revenue and documents is Personal Use.
1.4 "Commercial Use" means any of the following, whether or not for profit and whether or not a fee is charged:
  (a) selling, renting, or distributing for a fee the Software or any modified version or derivative work;
  (b) bundling the Software or any modified version or derivative work into a paid product, paid course, paid community, membership resource or other paid content;
  (c) providing services based on the Software or any modified version or derivative work, including but not limited to SaaS, hosting, online tools, or paid deployment services;
  (d) internal deployment by a company, team, studio, institution or other organization for use by multiple people;
  (e) customizing, deploying or installing the Software for clients for a fee;
  (f) using the Software or any modified version as a means of profit in advertising, lead generation or marketing campaigns;
  (g) any other use intended to obtain direct or indirect commercial benefit.

