5. Data and Third-Party Services

5.1 The Software runs in the user's own browser and stores data on the user's own device. The Author does not collect or store, and cannot access, any user data.
5.2 Third-party services configured and used by the user (including AI APIs, hosting platforms, and monitored websites) are the responsibility of the user and the respective third party, including their fees, availability, content and data handling.
5.3 Users are responsible for safekeeping their backup files, vault password, and any certificates, private keys or other sensitive files stored in the Software.

